<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman cuts Sandvik.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman cuts Sandvik.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sandvik AB was cut to &quot;market underperformer&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately availble .</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 17 1542 4367</p>
</text>
